### ============================================================================
### SUPERMARKET API TEST SUITE
### Requires VS Code "REST Client" Extension
### Click "Send Request" above any endpoint to execute it.
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
# Paste your token here after logging in!
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE 

### ============================================================================
### 1. USER ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================

### Register a new User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/CreateUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Josiah Tester",
  "email": "test@store.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone_number": "08011223344",
  "age": 28
}

### Login User (Copy the token from the response and paste it in @token above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/LoginUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@store.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123!"
}


### ============================================================================
### 2. PRODUCT ENDPOINTS (Requires Token)
### ============================================================================

### Create a New Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/CreateProduct
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Peak Milk Powder 400g",
  "barcode": "100200300",
  "sku": "DAIRY-PEAK-400",
  "category": "Dairy",
  "costPrice": 1200,
  "sellingPrice": 1500,
  "quantity": 50,
  "unit": "tin",
  "reorderLevel": 10,
  "isPerishable": true,
  "description": "Full cream milk powder"
}

### Get All Products (Test pagination and filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10&category=Dairy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Product by Barcode (The "Scanner" Test!)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/barcode/100200300
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================================
### 3. REPORT ENDPOINTS (Requires Token)
### ============================================================================

### Get Daily Revenue (Will show 0 until we build the Sales logic tomorrow)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/daily-revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Low Stock Products (Will return empty unless quantity < reorderLevel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
